@startuml SmartPlacementTest_ListeningReading
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ParticipantPadding 20
skinparam BoxPadding 12

title UniLish — Smart Placement Test (Step 0–1): Intro & Listening/Reading

actor User

participant "PlacementTestIntroModal\n(Client)" as Modal
participant "ListeningReading\nPage (Client)" as LR

box "Client Store (Zustand + sessionStorage)" #EEF2FF
    participant "usePlacementTestStore" as PTStore
end box

box "Server — Express API" #F0FFF4
    participant "PlacementTestRuntimeController" as RuntimeCtrl
    participant "PlacementSessionController" as SessionCtrl
end box

box "Services & Repositories" #E8F5E9
    participant "placementTestRuntimeService" as RuntimeSvc
    participant "placementSessionService" as SessionSvc
end box

box "Data Layer" #FFF8E1
    database "MongoDB" as Mongo
end box

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════
' STEP 0 — INTRO & BOOTSTRAPPING
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════
== STEP 0 — Intro & Bootstrapping ==

User -> Modal : Open placement test intro page
User -> Modal : Click "Tôi đã sẵn sàng"
Modal --> LR : navigate('/dashboard/placement-test/lr')

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════
' STEP 1 — LISTENING/READING RUNTIME
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════
== STEP 1 — Listening & Reading Runtime ==

LR -> LR : useActivePlacementTestQuery(language, isAuthenticated)
LR -> RuntimeCtrl : GET /placement-tests/runtime/active?language=en\n(with fallback chain: en → en-US → english)
RuntimeCtrl -> RuntimeSvc : getActive(language)
RuntimeSvc -> Mongo : findOne({ language, status: 'active' })
Mongo --> RuntimeSvc : PlacementTest { _id, modules[], cefrMapping }
note right of RuntimeSvc
  **ActivePlacementTest structure:**
  - placementTestId / _id
  - mcqModule → parts[].manualContent.questionItems
  - essayModule → topicsByLevel, promptImageUrl, wordLimits
  - speakingModule → config, parts.{part1, part2, part3}
  - cefrMapping → weights, thresholds
end note
RuntimeSvc --> RuntimeCtrl : ActivePlacementTest
RuntimeCtrl --> LR : 200 { _id, placementTestId, mcqModule, essayModule, speakingModule, cefrMapping }

LR -> LR : **useEffect**: extract essayModule & speakingModule
LR -> PTStore : setTestConfig({\n  placementTestId,\n  essayModule,\n  speakingModule,\n  cefrMapping\n})

LR -> LR : useCreatePlacementAttemptMutation(activeTest._id)
LR -> RuntimeCtrl : POST /placement-tests/runtime/attempts\n{ placementTestId }
RuntimeCtrl -> RuntimeSvc : createAttempt(userId, { placementTestId })
RuntimeSvc -> Mongo : create PlacementAttempt {\n  userId, placementTestId,\n  status: 'in_progress',\n  expiresAt: now + 90min\n}
Mongo --> RuntimeSvc : RuntimeAttempt { attemptId, answerSheet[], expiresAt, totalQuestions }
RuntimeSvc --> RuntimeCtrl : RuntimeAttempt
RuntimeCtrl --> LR : 201 { attemptId, answerSheet, expiresAt, totalQuestions }

LR -> PTStore : setAttemptId(attemptId)
LR -> LR : mapAttemptToParts(attempt)\n→ hydrate parts, questions, groups, audio

loop **Autosave** (debounce 800ms, max retry 3)
    User -> LR : select option / flag question
    LR -> LR : useAnswerState.handleAnswer/handleFlag
    LR -> LR : useAutosave.queueSave(questionId, { selectedOption, flagged })
    note right of LR
      **Debounce 800ms:**
      - Clear previous timeout
      - Set new timeout
      - On timeout → flushPendingChanges()
    end note
    LR -> RuntimeCtrl : PATCH /placement-tests/runtime/attempts/:attemptId/answers\n{ answers: [{ questionId, selectedOption, flagged }] }
    RuntimeCtrl -> RuntimeSvc : saveAnswers(userId, attemptId, { answers })
    RuntimeSvc -> Mongo : bulkWrite answerSheet (update selectedOption, flagged)
    Mongo --> RuntimeSvc : OK
    RuntimeSvc --> RuntimeCtrl : { attemptId, status, answerSheet, progress }
    RuntimeCtrl --> LR : 200 { attemptId, status, answerSheet, progress: { answered, total, flagged } }
end

User -> LR : click "Nộp bài" (or timer expires → auto-submit)
LR -> LR : setIsSubmitting(true)
LR -> LR : cancelScheduledSaves()
LR -> LR : await flushPendingChanges(allowRetry: false)
LR -> LR : useSubmitPlacementAttemptMutation.mutateAsync(attemptId)
LR -> RuntimeCtrl : POST /placement-tests/runtime/attempts/:attemptId/submit
RuntimeCtrl -> RuntimeSvc : submitAttempt(userId, attemptId)
RuntimeSvc -> Mongo : **Score LR** + mark status='submitted' + log durationSeconds
Mongo --> RuntimeSvc : SubmitPlacementAttemptResult
note right of RuntimeSvc
  **SubmitPlacementAttemptResult:**
  - attempt: { scoring.mcqScoreNormalized, durationSeconds, answerSheet, totalQuestions }
  - profileUpdate: { placementTestScore, currentLevel, weakSkills }
  - sessionId (optional, if auto-created)
  - placementSession (optional)
end note
RuntimeSvc --> RuntimeCtrl : SubmitPlacementAttemptResult
RuntimeCtrl --> LR : 200 { attempt, profileUpdate, sessionId?, placementSession? }

LR -> LR : **Calculate lrRawScore:**\nMath.round(attempt.scoring.mcqScoreNormalized × 100)\nOR profileUpdate.placementTestScore

LR -> LR : useCreatePlacementSessionMutation.mutateAsync
LR -> SessionCtrl : POST /placement-sessions\n{ lrAttemptId: attemptId, lrRawScore }
SessionCtrl -> SessionSvc : createSession(userId, { lrAttemptId, lrRawScore })
SessionSvc -> Mongo : create PlacementSession {\n  userId,\n  lrAttemptId,\n  lrRawScore,\n  currentModule: 'writing',\n  status: 'in_progress'\n}
Mongo --> SessionSvc : { sessionId }
SessionSvc --> SessionCtrl : { sessionId }
SessionCtrl --> LR : 201 { sessionId }

LR -> PTStore : setAttemptId(attemptId)
LR -> PTStore : setLrRawScore(lrRawScore)
LR -> PTStore : setSessionId(sessionId)
LR -> PTStore : setCurrentModule('writing')

LR -> LR : buildSubmissionSummary(result.attempt)\n→ { completedMinutes, submittedQuestions, totalQuestions }
LR -> LR : setSubmissionSummary(summary)
LR -> LR : setIsSubmitting(false)

LR --> User : **SubmissionSuccessCard** (overlay)\nShow: completedMinutes, submittedQuestions/totalQuestions
User -> LR : click "Tiếp tục phần Writing"
LR --> User : navigate('/dashboard/placement-test/writing')

@enduml
